{"id":"n63801-1-16","stage":1,"title":"가위 · 剪刀","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63801-1-16-1","ko":"엄마, 가위 어디 있어요? 내일 미술 수업에 필요해요.","zh":"妈妈，剪刀在哪儿呢？我明天上美术课要用。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가위","meaning":"剪刀","explanation":"가위：剪刀","readings":[{"term":"가위","audio":"/audio/13bc3a4ef5d8535ed567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63801","senseId":"1","lemma":"가위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미술","meaning":"美术","explanation":"미술：美术","readings":[{"term":"미술","audio":"/audio/e5f3334a3919e9e30fb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28771","senseId":"1","lemma":"미술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수업에","meaning":"授课，讲课","explanation":"수업：授课，讲课；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64597","senseId":"1","lemma":"수업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"필요해요.","meaning":"必需，必要","explanation":"필요하다：必需，必要；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"필요하다","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46945","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"13bc3a4ef5d8535e","term":"가위","zh":"剪刀","audio":"/audio/13bc3a4ef5d8535ed567.mp3","entryId":"63801","definition":"剪纸片、布料、头发等的工具。","pronunciation":["가위"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"e5f3334a3919e9e3","term":"미술","zh":"美术","audio":"/audio/e5f3334a3919e9e30fb0.mp3","entryId":"28771","definition":"绘画或雕刻等表现视觉美的艺术。","pronunciation":["미ː술"]},{"id":"01c1761e85dc638b","term":"수업","zh":"授课，讲课","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3","entryId":"64597","definition":"教师教学生知识或技术。","pronunciation":["수업"]},{"id":"b98947c9698402e3","term":"필요하다","zh":"必需，必要","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3","entryId":"46945","definition":"一定要有的。","pronunciation":["피료하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9db957fbe54114d22d48.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63801-1-16-2","ko":"네 책상 서랍 안에 있어.","zh":"在你的书桌抽屉里哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你的（네 是 너의 的缩略）","explanation":"너：你的（네 是 너의 的缩略）；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책상","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lem